     This is Version Trion BBS 1.0 !!

     (Well actually this is the (last) update to version V1.0)

     On my BBS there are a vew Trion BBS V1.0 archives.

     a TrionBBS100.LHA archive of 1.344.544 bytes  (especially for aminet)
     a TrionBBS100.LZX archive of   952.290 bytes  (frequable as 'TRION')

     I didn't hatch the complete versions because I don't think every
     one wants to receive them by mail .. especially the people in
     other countries like sweden. If people want the complete
     archive they can find in on my BBS, and probably on the mail HQ
     of tron net, and on aminet.
     

     This archive contains a BBS where a new door command was fixed.
     A Tick with better help text and some of docs files.

     New things will come soon in a Trion101.lzx archive.

     Utils:   TrionTick, BBS
     Docs:    Tmp, Tick, Features, general docs


